# Downloaded third-party sources stay LOCAL. FM-os is a public repo, so committing the
# PDFs/HTML here would be redistributing other people's copyrighted work — the exact
# thing every SOURCE.md says we do not do. Fetching for personal study is fine;
# republishing is not.
#
# What IS committed: the fetcher (scripts/fetch_reading_sources.py), the digest plan,
# and our own per-entry notes (SOURCE.md / PRIOR.md / INDEX.md). Anyone can regenerate
# the corpus from those in one command.
*.pdf
*.html
page.txt
